  "description": "API probe P22-B, levels (phase1.24 item 3.4, decision 296): on the plane, a fill layer (BaseColor and Height active) with a levels content effect and a white mask holding a levels mask effect; in the first session and after save/reopen: the default affected_channel and get_parameters, then levels.LevelsParamsRGB built with all six fields (input_min, input_max, gamma, output_min, output_max, clamp) and set on BaseColor, levels.LevelsParamsMono built with all six fields and set on Height, an RGB value on the Height levels, and Mono and RGB values on the mask levels, each read back through LevelsEffectNode.get_parameters. Exercises the levels module, LevelsParamsRGB, LevelsParamsMono and their six fields, and LevelsEffectNode.get_parameters.",
